TITLE Equilibration with talc rhodochrosite sepiolite sepiolite(d) Pb(OH)2 at 100C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5 charge
    Ba 0.1
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Talc 0 10
    Rhodochrosite 0 10
    Sepiolite 0 10
    Sepiolite(d) 0 10
    Pb(OH)2 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -totals Mn(+3)
END
